span style="font-size:9pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:15.59%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:9pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0.05pt 0pt;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_irJD1gOzI0qnHqqsHVdg1A" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2025_To_9_30_2025_us-gaap_DividendsAxis_epm_O2026Q1DividendsMember_a68ur6iXA0m_5VG_SdK9Ug" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockDividendsPerShareCashPaid" scale="0" id="Tc_wMYdFSKCdUqvLxEGsLugPw_6_3">0.12</ix:nonFraction></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:4.23%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="font-size:9pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.67%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="font-size:9pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:13.53%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:9pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0.05pt 0pt;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_irJD1gOzI0qnHqqsHVdg1A" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_9_30_2024_us-gaap_DividendsAxis_epm_O2025Q1DividendsMember_JW1KPjG_Z0yleOfeALWq_Q" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockDividendsPerShareCashPaid" scale="0" id="Tc_D1m-sCTZ_Uux15DPMsGxMw_6_6">0.12</ix:nonFraction></p></td></tr></table></ix:continuation><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">On <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_7_1_2026_To_9_10_2026_us-gaap_DividendsAxis_epm_O2027Q1DividendsMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_xcicHNWex0Os2wfY_vMePg" format="ixt:date-monthname-day-year-en" name="us-gaap:DividendsPayableDateDeclaredDayMonthAndYear" id="Narr_S5S_AwMGYkOPN8IFn0MzgQ">September 10, 2026</ix:nonNumeric>, Evolution&#8217;s Board of Directors approved and declared a quarterly dividend of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_irJD1gOzI0qnHqqsHVdg1A" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2026_To_9_10_2026_us-gaap_DividendsAxis_epm_O2027Q1DividendsMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_xcicHNWex0Os2wfY_vMePg" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockDividendsPerShareDeclared" scale="0" id="Narr_ZwPUQl3q0US_3hEozAfWNA">0.12</ix:nonFraction> per common share payable <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_7_1_2026_To_9_10_2026_us-gaap_DividendsAxis_epm_O2027Q1DividendsMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_xcicHNWex0Os2wfY_vMePg" format="ixt:date-monthname-day-year-en" name="us-gaap:DividendPayableDateToBePaidDayMonthAndYear" id="Narr_QJjQi6B-nkGEOaJm7b16pQ">September 30, 2026</ix:nonNumeric><span style="white-space:pre-wrap;">.  Refer to Note 15, </span><i style="font-style:italic;">&#8220;Subsequent Events,&#8221; </i>for a further discussion.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="color:#212529;background:#ffffff;">On August 20, 2026, the Company completed a public offering issuing an aggregate of </span><span style="color:#212529;background:#ffffff;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_wNmYXdFAE0Sov4htjq8r2w" contextRef="Duration_8_20_2026_To_8_20_2026_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_V5SUYcaFm0yDpnn6Ns3LXA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" scale="6" id="Narr_cCSpO8aVbEWgrxpkJLbXuA">4.3</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#212529;background:#ffffff;"> million shares of its common stock. </span>See Note 15, &#8220;<i style="font-style:italic;">Subsequent Events,&#8221;</i> for further details.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="color:#212529;visibility:hidden;background:#ffffff;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="color:#212529;background:#ffffff;">On October&#160;21, 2024, the Company entered into an At-the-Market (&#8220;ATM&#8221;) equity Sales Agreement with Roth Capital Partners, LLC (the &#8220;Lead Agent&#8221;), Northland Securities Inc., and A.G.P./Alliance Global Partners pursuant to which the Company may issue and sell, from time to time, up to </span><span style="color:#212529;background:#ffffff;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_gDp5XCeWnEippY-t1_RnwQ" contextRef="As_Of_10_21_2024_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_epm_AtmSalesAgreementMember_QwBkpVni5EytxpmELzMPYQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="epm:MaximumAmountAuthorizedForSaleInEquitySalesAgreementAgreement" scale="6" id="Narr_SA0FKAefp0a9Z76XmT5agw">30.0</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#212529;background:#ffffff;"> million of shares of common stock through or to the Lead Agent, acting as agent or principal to facilitate acquisitions and other general corporate purposes. On February 11, 2026, the Company executed a new ATM equity Sales Agreement, substantially consistent with the original October 2024 agreement (the &#8220;ATM Sales Agreements&#8221;) restoring the </span><span style="color:#212529;background:#ffffff;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_gDp5XCeWnEippY-t1_RnwQ" contextRef="As_Of_2_11_2026_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_epm_AtmSalesAgreementMember_wnK6RZgsp0OS7Sns2GfAXQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="epm:MaximumAmountAuthorizedForSaleInEquitySalesAgreementAgreement" scale="6" id="Narr_L-N8TXNyCUaM2dJ7Iu6ZSQ">30.0</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#212529;background:#ffffff;"> million common stock sales capacity. For the year ended June 30,&#160;2026, the Company sold a total of approximately </span><span style="color:#212529;background:#ffffff;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_wNmYXdFAE0Sov4htjq8r2w" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2025_To_6_30_2026_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_epm_AtmSalesAgreementMember_kQfph9cjCUS9jCxIzzmLhQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" scale="6" id="Narr_hGelDkjO4EOmbpR8F-3hOw">1.4</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#212529;background:#ffffff;"> million shares of its common stock under the ATM Sales Agreements for net proceeds of approximately </span><span style="color:#212529;background:#ffffff;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_gDp5XCeWnEippY-t1_RnwQ" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2025_To_6_30_2026_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_epm_AtmSalesAgreementMember_kQfph9cjCUS9jCxIzzmLhQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SaleOfStockConsiderationReceivedOnTransaction" scale="6" id="Narr_Qnwn4xUybk-aOVVUF8LIAQ">5.8</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#212529;background:#ffffff;"> million, net of </span><span style="color:#212529;background:#ffffff;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_gDp5XCeWnEippY-t1_RnwQ" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2025_To_6_30_2026_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_epm_AtmSalesAgreementMember_kQfph9cjCUS9jCxIzzmLhQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:PaymentsOfStockIssuanceCosts" scale="6" id="Narr_FuK8luw5WkqAJtHpzy46xQ">0.2</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#212529;background:#ffffff;"> million of offering costs incurred. For the year ended June 30,&#160;2025, the Company sold a total of approximately </span><span style="color:#212529;background:#ffffff;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_wNmYXdFAE0Sov4htjq8r2w" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_6_30_2025_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_epm_AtmSalesAgreementMember_hzsTJ-cIM0WtH9tdSg_Elg" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" scale="6" id="Narr_t_wGiaiClUy7VxMpjmateA">0.7</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#212529;background:#ffffff;"> million shares of its common stock under the ATM Sales Agreements for net proceeds of approximately </span><span style="color:#212529;background:#ffffff;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_gDp5XCeWnEippY-t1_RnwQ" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_6_30_2025_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_epm_AtmSalesAgreementMember_hzsTJ-cIM0WtH9tdSg_Elg" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SaleOfStockConsiderationReceivedOnTransaction" scale="6" id="Narr_jgbpZSFOCkSwep13PAawxQ">3.5</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#212529;background:#ffffff;"> million, after deducting </span><span style="color:#212529;background:#ffffff;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_gDp5XCeWnEippY-t1_RnwQ" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_6_30_2025_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_epm_AtmSalesAgreementMember_hzsTJ-cIM0WtH9tdSg_Elg" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:PaymentsOfStockIssuanceCosts" scale="6" id="Narr_lRXAEr7zZ0-mHXVeehpilg">0.3</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#212529;background:#ffffff;"> million in offering costs. Net proceeds from the sales of common stock were used to fund a portion of our Louisiana Minerals acquisitions and for general corporate purposes. </span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">On September 8, 2022, the Board of Directors approved a share repurchase program, under which the Company was authorized to repurchase up to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_gDp5XCeWnEippY-t1_RnwQ" contextRef="As_Of_9_8_2022_srt_ShareRepurchaseProgramAxis_epm_ShareRepurchaseProgram2022Member_Hfy9mwiXrE2Iw9GRmMh3yQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="srt:StockRepurchaseProgramAuthorizedAmount1" scale="6" id="Narr_1MsON9tNQkW_sU16RlEObg">25.0</ix:nonFraction> million of its common stock in the open market through December 31, 2024. The Company funded repurchases from working capital and cash provided by operating activities. The share repurchase program was complimentary to the existing dividend policy and was a tax efficient means to further improve shareholder return. The shares were repurchased in open market transactions, through privately negotiated transactions or by other means in accordance with federal securities laws. The Company did not repurchase any shares of common stock under the plan during the six months ended December&#160;31,&#160;2024, the plan&#8217;s termination date. While the plan was in effect, a total of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_wNmYXdFAE0Sov4htjq8r2w" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2024_srt_ShareRepurchaseProgramAxis_epm_ShareRepurchaseProgram2022Member_mw8KFFlKUkmK_2wG7Ycpig" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="epm:TreasuryStockSharesAcquiredToDate" scale="6" id="Narr_m7elANsxnke4MsNIpgse7w">0.8</ix:nonFraction> million shares of the Company&#8217;s common stock were repurchased under the program at a total cost of approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_gDp5XCeWnEippY-t1_RnwQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2024_srt_ShareRepurchaseProgramAxis_epm_ShareRepurchaseProgram2022Member_mw8KFFlKUkmK_2wG7Ycpig" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:TreasuryStockCommonValue" scale="6" id="Narr_JtyevSqFF0meiJ9DxpQ0zw">4.6</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million, including incremental direct transaction costs.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">During the&#160;years ended June&#160;30,&#160;2026 and 2025, the Company acquired treasury stock upon the ordinary course of scheduled vestings of employee stock-based awards to fund payroll tax withholding obligations. These treasury shares were subsequently cancelled. Such shares were valued at fair market value on the date of vesting. <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_7_1_2025_To_6_30_2026_KseTYv8A0kKeZ3U92N1auA" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfTreasuryStockByClassTextBlock" id="Group_F-REI5zbE0aD80sOTw23Mw" continuedAt="Group_F-REI5zbE0aD80sOTw23Mw_2" escape="true">The following table summarizes all treasury stock purchases in the years ended June&#160;30,&#160;2026 and 2025 (in thousands, except per share amounts):</ix:nonNumeric></p><ix:continuation id="Group_F-REI5zbE0aD80sOTw23Mw_2"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;min-height:0.0pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:0pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-size:16pt;height:max-content;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;width:80%;"><tr style="height:1pt;"><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:57.03%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:4.23%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';