of diluted earnings per common share because the effect would have been anti-dilutive due to the net loss. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 8pt 0pt;">Unvested restricted stock awards (both time-vested and performance-based), totaling approximately <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_wNmYXdFAE0Sov4htjq8r2w" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_6_30_2025_us-gaap_AntidilutiveSecuritiesExcludedFromComputationOfEarningsPerShareByAntidilutiveSecuritiesAxis_us-gaap_RestrictedStockMember_SzugcxmEqkWMQnqTd8E4JA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AntidilutiveSecuritiesExcludedFromComputationOfEarningsPerShareAmount" scale="6" id="Narr_mIQIiWL7bUS6rXtwcfWlkg">0.1</ix:nonFraction> million for the&#160;year ended June&#160;30,&#160;2025, were not included in the computation of diluted earnings per common share because the effect would have been anti-dilutive.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 8pt 0pt;">In addition, unvested performance-based restricted stock awards and unvested contingent restricted stock units that would not meet the performance criteria as of the period end are excluded from the computation of diluted earnings per common share.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Pursuant to year end, in August 2026, the Company issued an additional <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_wNmYXdFAE0Sov4htjq8r2w" contextRef="Duration_8_20_2026_To_8_20_2026_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_V5SUYcaFm0yDpnn6Ns3LXA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" scale="6" id="Narr_8BDVtxcq8EGM-mux0NVyhg">4.3</ix:nonFraction><span style="white-space:pre-wrap;"> million shares of common stock.  See Note 15, &#8220;</span><i style="font-style:italic;">Subsequent Events,&#8221;</i> for further details.</p></ix:nonNumeric></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">71</p></div></div>
