width:14.15%;border-bottom:3px double #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:9pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0.05pt 0pt;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_gDp5XCeWnEippY-t1_RnwQ" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2025_A6l7VhAU8UabbTuqZPYlYQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AccruedLiabilitiesCurrent" scale="3" id="Tc__SLgT08dwUiI-1adsop62g_27_6">6,909</ix:nonFraction></p></td></tr></table><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></ix:nonNumeric></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_7_1_2025_To_6_30_2026_KseTYv8A0kKeZ3U92N1auA" name="us-gaap:SubsequentEventsTextBlock" id="Tb_gQRiclCQPkWF9v2kEfIC8g" continuedAt="Tb_gQRiclCQPkWF9v2kEfIC8g_cont1" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Note&#160;15. Subsequent Events</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;">Senior Secured Credit Facility</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">On August 20, 2026, the Company entered into a letter agreement with MidFirst Bank pursuant to which the borrowing base on its Senior Secured Credit Facility was temporarily increased from $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_gDp5XCeWnEippY-t1_RnwQ" contextRef="As_Of_8_19_2026_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_epm_SeniorSecuredReserveBasedCreditFacilityMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_RJ6OZgiuA06F_-nl7MlztA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LineOfCreditFacilityCurrentBorrowingCapacity" scale="6" id="Narr_7cbjSaXfRkWvzK_UeDSIig">65.0</ix:nonFraction> million to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_gDp5XCeWnEippY-t1_RnwQ" contextRef="As_Of_8_20_2026_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_epm_SeniorSecuredReserveBasedCreditFacilityMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_gcC4xiKLdU6ihq0LToHv1w" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LineOfCreditFacilityCurrentBorrowingCapacity" scale="6" id="Narr_SU722eBKqk6xzHwDtT8JZA">73.0</ix:nonFraction> million from August 20, 2026 until October 20, 2026, unless redetermined early in accordance with the terms of the credit agreement. The Company currently expects to being its semi-annual Fall redetermination on or about October 1, 2026.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><span style="font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;">Common Stock Offering</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">On August 20, 2026, the Company completed a public offering of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_wNmYXdFAE0Sov4htjq8r2w" contextRef="Duration_8_20_2026_To_8_20_2026_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_epm_PublicOfferingMember_dCABjSusEE6zQmMNlGiBAg" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" scale="6" id="Narr_alFBhH1BPki0_sF3_LnZcg">4.3</ix:nonFraction> million shares of its common stock, at an offering price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_irJD1gOzI0qnHqqsHVdg1A" contextRef="As_Of_8_20_2026_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_epm_PublicOfferingMember_7_z6Thfq8EitQ7p5oZtJ9A" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SharesIssuedPricePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_5ULgsII9gUeMecXB0fmi7Q">3.25</ix:nonFraction><span style="white-space:pre-wrap;"> per share (the &#8220;Offering&#8221;).  The Company received net proceeds of approximately </span>$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_gDp5XCeWnEippY-t1_RnwQ" contextRef="Duration_8_20_2026_To_8_20_2026_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_V5SUYcaFm0yDpnn6Ns3LXA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SaleOfStockConsiderationReceivedOnTransaction" scale="6" id="Narr_kTrsBvThp0a6Y2-S1t9N4A">12.8</ix:nonFraction> million from the Offering, after deducting underwriting discounts and commissions and estimated offering expenses. Net proceeds from the Offering, together with borrowings under its Senior Secured Credit Facility and cash on hand, were used to fund the Permian Minerals Acquisition (defined below). <span style="font-family:'TimesNewRomanRegular';"> </span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'TimesNewRomanRegular';visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;">Purchase of Permian Minerals</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-style:italic;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">On August 20, 2026, the Company completed the acquisition of mineral and royalty interests in the core Midland Basin of the Permian Basin from a non-affiliated private seller for a total purchase price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_gDp5XCeWnEippY-t1_RnwQ" contextRef="Duration_8_20_2026_To_8_20_2026_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_epm_PermianMineralsAcquisitionMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_O2PLFVPjC0WjnpIqHp8lzQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:PaymentsToAcquireProductiveAssets" scale="6" id="Narr_z0O0ly5MvUuaZRO8BO9NxA">16.0</ix:nonFraction> million (the &#8220;Permian </p></ix:nonNumeric></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">74</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:79.3%;border:0;margin:30pt 10.35% 30pt 10.35%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:10.35%;padding-right:10.35%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:21.6pt;min-height:41.75pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 30pt 0pt;"><a href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt 0pt 6pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">EVOLUTION PETROLEUM CORPORATION</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">NOTES TO CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS</b></p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;"><ix:continuation id="Tb_gQRiclCQPkWF9v2kEfIC8g_cont1"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">Minerals Acquisition&#8221;), subject to customary post-closing adjustments. The Permian Minerals Acquisition has an&#160;effective date of August 1, 2026.&#160;The Company funded the purchase price for the Permian Minerals Acquisition with a combination of net proceeds from its concurrent public equity offering and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_gDp5XCeWnEippY-t1_RnwQ" contextRef="Duration_8_20_2026_To_8_20_2026_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_epm_PermianMineralsAcquisitionMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_O2PLFVPjC0WjnpIqHp8lzQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="epm:AssetAcquisitionConsiderationPaidFromLineOfCreditFacility" scale="6" id="Narr_2IcVSul30UOAvA5ky9lOHQ">3.2</ix:nonFraction> million in borrowings under its Senior Secured Credit Facility. The acquired assets include approximately <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_acre_SDqRp70Dl0GyNZ5eO_EDRA" contextRef="Duration_8_20_2026_To_8_20_2026_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_epm_PermianMineralsAcquisitionMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_O2PLFVPjC0WjnpIqHp8lzQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="epm:AssetAcquisitionMineralAndRoyaltyInterestsNetRoyaltyAcres" scale="0" id="Narr_1C35AawrEEeMIHBKOVYSyw">3,420</ix:nonFraction> net royalty acres across Reagan, Martin, Midland, Glasscock, and Upton Counties, Texas.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;">Dividend Declaration</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">On <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_7_1_2026_To_9_10_2026_us-gaap_DividendsAxis_epm_O2027Q1DividendsMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_xcicHNWex0Os2wfY_vMePg" format="ixt:date-monthname-day-year-en" name="us-gaap:DividendsPayableDateDeclaredDayMonthAndYear" id="Narr_elrI29upA0mgUrnfuqrhGA">September 10, 2026</ix:nonNumeric>, the Company declared a quarterly cash dividend of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_irJD1gOzI0qnHqqsHVdg1A" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2026_To_9_10_2026_us-gaap_DividendsAxis_epm_O2027Q1DividendsMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_xcicHNWex0Os2wfY_vMePg" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockDividendsPerShareDeclared" scale="0" id="Narr_Dto1D_s_-EKaGjAkJbWVqA">0.12</ix:nonFraction>&#160;per share of common stock to shareholders of record on <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_7_1_2026_To_9_10_2026_us-gaap_DividendsAxis_epm_O2027Q1DividendsMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_xcicHNWex0Os2wfY_vMePg" format="ixt:date-monthname-day-year-en" name="us-gaap:DividendsPayableDateOfRecordDayMonthAndYear" id="Narr_AsFZHfkOJU6Ki22ScicgXQ">September 21, 2026</ix:nonNumeric> and payable on <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_7_1_2026_To_9_10_2026_us-gaap_DividendsAxis_epm_O2027Q1DividendsMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_xcicHNWex0Os2wfY_vMePg" format="ixt:date-monthname-day-year-en" name="us-gaap:DividendPayableDateToBePaidDayMonthAndYear" id="Narr_IbIGzigarEmA8uquQDqeag">September 30, 2026</ix:nonNumeric>.</p></ix:continuation><p style="display:none;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';line-height:0pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:0pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">75</p></div></div>
